  "content": {
    "title": "关于召开2014年全省普通高校毕业生就业工作会议的通知",
    "source": "",
    "publishDate": "2014-03-17",
    "bodyHtml": "\n                        <div class=\"mainlist bor\">\n            <h5>\n                <div class=\"ttt text20\">\n                    通知公告</div>\n            </h5>\n            <div>\n                <div class=\"titles\">\n                    <span id=\"lblTitle\" style=\"display:inline-block;\"><b><font size=\"5\">关于召开2014年全省普通高校毕业生就业工作会议的通知</font></b></span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"xian2\">\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"Issues\">\n                    <span id=\"lblIssue\" style=\"display:inline-block;\"><font size=\"3\">发布部门:    发布时间:2014-3-17 0:00:00</font></span>\n                </div>\n               \n                <div id=\"tdNoticesContent\"><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 24px;\">&nbsp;</span></span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><span style=\"color: red; letter-spacing: 8px; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 56px;\">吉林省教育厅文件</span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&nbsp;</span></span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">吉教学字〔2014〕4号&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 16px;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -1px; font-size: 29px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><span style=\"letter-spacing: -1px; font-size: 29px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&nbsp;</span></span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 47px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 29px;\">关于召开2014年全省普通高校毕业生就业工作会议的通知</span></strong></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 黑体; font-size: 29px;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 37px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">各普通高等学校：</span></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 37px; text-indent: 42px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">为认真学习贯彻党的十八届三中全会和省委十届三次会议精神，全面落实教育部2014年全国普通高校毕业生就业工作网络视频会议的工作要求，总结近几年我省普通高校毕业生就业工作，部署2014年全省普通高校毕业生就业工作，定于2014年3月11日下午召开2014年全省普通高校毕业生就业工作会议。现将有关事项通知如下：</span></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 37px; text-indent: 42px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 黑体;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">一、会议时间</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 37px; text-indent: 42px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">月11日</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">（星期二）下午14:00-15:30</span></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 37px; text-indent: 42px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 黑体;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">二、会议地点及参会人员</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 37px; text-indent: 42px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">1.</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">会议地点：长春教育宾馆六楼报告厅。</span></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 37px; text-indent: 42px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">2.</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">参会人员：各高等学校分管就业工作副书记或副校长，就业工作部门负责人各1人。</span></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 37px; text-indent: 42px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 黑体;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">三、其他事项</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 37px; text-indent: 42px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">1.</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">请各高校于3月10日（星期一）11:00前将参会人员名单（见附件）以传真或电子邮件方式报送省高校毕业生就业指导中心。</span></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 37px; text-indent: 42px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">2.</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">届时请参会人员提前15分钟入场就座完毕。</span></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 37px; text-indent: 42px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">联 系 人： 张&nbsp; 影</span></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 37px; text-indent: 42px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">联系电话：0431-84689772</span></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 37px; text-indent: 42px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">传&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 真：0431-84636128</span></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 37px; text-indent: 42px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">邮&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 箱：774964160@qq.com</span></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 37px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 37px; text-indent: 42px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 黑体;\">附件：</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">参会回执</span></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 37px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 37px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">吉林省教育厅</span></span></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px 42px 0px 0px; text-align: center; line-height: 37px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2014年3月7日</span></span></span></p><p><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 24px;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: 黑体;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: 黑体;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: 黑体;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: 黑体;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: 黑体;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></span></strong></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 19px;\">&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 19px;\">吉林省教育厅办公室&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2014年3月7日印发 &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></span></p><p></p></div>\n                <div class=\"clearfloat\">\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"xian2\">\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class=\"clearfloat\">\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"xian2\">\n            </div>\n            <table width=\"100%\">\n                <tbody><tr>\n                    <td width=\"10%\" height=\"23\" bgcolor=\"#FFFFFF\" align=\"right\">\n                        附件：\n                    </td>\n                    <td>\n                        &nbsp;\n                    </td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                    <td>\n                        &nbsp;\n                    </td>\n                    <td width=\"90%\" height=\"23\" align=\"left\" bgcolor=\"#FFFFFF\">\n                        \n                    </td>\n                </tr>\n            </tbody></table>\n        </div>\n                    ",
